# SurvNG model installer image

This container image downloads third-party model weights for SurvNG Docker
deployments. It does not include SurvNG application code or runtime weights.

The installer image itself is MIT-licensed (same as SurvNG). The models it
downloads are **not** MIT and are **not** redistributed inside the GHCR runtime
image. You must comply with each model's license when downloading and using them.

See `THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md` in this directory (also at `/opt/install/` in the
image) for license summaries and attribution requirements.

When you redistribute this installer image, retain this notice and
`THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md` with the image or in accompanying documentation.

SurvNG is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ultralytics, Apple, Intel, or
other model vendors.
